ks with Michael B Jordan to star and  a script written by ready player one  Zack Penn  however with the latest announcement  it's safe to say that that's been  cancelled there's also no word yet if  Laurence Fishburne or Hugo Weaving will  be back to reprise their roles as  Morpheus and Agent Smith respectively  but anything is possible in the matrix  so don't count them out even if it means  us seeing a younger version of Morpheus  which Variety reported may be recast for  a younger take the studio had previously  been considering a matrix prequel  revolving around a young Morpheus that's  all we know so far for matrix for stay  tuned to the channel for more updates  breakdowns and theories as this will  surely be a movie to keep our eyes on  you can follow me on youtube at things  story whitey and until next time  remember daddy loves you very much
 

